Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:15:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix: resolve shot output and session discovery outside
 the fixture

shots.sh now resolves FAB_SHOT_DIR, or the branch-named default, against
the Mire checkout before entering the fixture, refuses a directory inside
the checkout, and passes shot.sh the absolute path. The captures run with
a private XDG_RUNTIME_DIR so the walkthrough scenario cannot pick another
open mire review session.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01McED3zcaewkwybS2P4vZya
